    "body": "Maintainer, after reading the cause (2026-11-12): \"so the mistake is thinking it will be fitting to the model instead of the stockbox\". That is the misunderstanding the dialog has to prevent: with a model imported and visible, \"Fit to the stock\" reads as \"fit to my part\". The wording must say that the vise grips the **stock** (the block the part is cut from), not the imported model, and that the stock is set on the Stock page.",
